          "type": "node",
          "parent": "z1",
          "label": "MessageController\n- service: MessageService\n- idempotency: IdempotencyGuard\n+ sendMessage(cmd): MessageId\n+ editMessage(id, text): void\n+ deleteMessage(id): void\n+ getMessages(convId, from, to): List",
          "html": "<div style='background:#dae8fc;padding:5px;font-weight:bold;border-bottom:1px solid #6c8ebf'>MessageController</div><div style='text-align:left;padding:5px;font-size:11px'>- service: MessageService<br>- idempotency: IdempotencyGuard</div><div style='border-top:1px solid #6c8ebf;text-align:left;padding:5px;font-size:11px'>+ sendMessage(cmd): MessageId<br>+ editMessage(id, text): void<br>+ deleteMessage(id): void<br>+ getMessages(convId, from, to): List</div>"
        },
        {
          "id": "cls-ms",
          "type": "node",
          "parent": "z1",
          "label": "MessageService\n- repo: MessageRepository\n- seqGen: SequenceGenerator\n- clock: LamportClock\n- fanout: FanoutService\n- blockList: BlockListChecker\n+ send(cmd): Message\n+ persist(m): void\n- assignSequence(m): void\n- assignLamport(m): void\n+ publishToKafka(m): void",
          "html": "<div style='background:#d5e8d4;padding:5px;font-weight:bold;border-bottom:1px solid #82b366'>MessageService</div><div style='text-align:left;padding:5px;font-size:11px'>- repo: MessageRepository<br>- seqGen: SequenceGenerator<br>- clock: LamportClock<br>- fanout: FanoutService<br>- blockList: BlockListChecker</div><div style='border-top:1px solid #82b366;text-align:left;padding:5px;font-size:11px'>+ send(cmd): Message<br>+ persist(m): void<br>- assignSequence(m): void<br>- assignLamport(m): void<br>+ publishToKafka(m): void</div>"
        },
        {
